@startuml

title Configuration Service - Static View

package "Configuration Service" {
    [Config Validator] as validator
    note right of validator
        - Validates parameter ranges
        - Returns OK or INVALID_PARAM
    end note

    [Config Store] as store
    note right of store
        - Get/Set typed config parameters
        - API examples:
          GetAdcSampleRate() -> uint16_t
          SetAdcSampleRate(uint16_t rate) -> status
          GetI2cClockSpeed() -> uint32_t
          SetI2cClockSpeed(uint32_t speed) -> status
    end note

    [NVM Persistence] as nvmPersist
    note right of nvmPersist
        - Saves config to NVM as JSON
        - Loads config from NVM on startup
    end note

    [Default Config] as defaults
    note right of defaults
        - Fallback values when NVM is empty/corrupt
    end note
}

[Central App Controller] as cac
[NVM Driver] as nvmDriver

cac --> validator : Typed Set calls (validates internally)
cac --> store : Typed Get/Set calls
nvmPersist --> nvmDriver : Read/Write JSON config
defaults ..> nvmPersist : Fallback on invalid NVM

note bottom of store
    No DID/RID awareness.
    Receives typed parameters only.
end note

@enduml